title: Changing Room
text: Everyone walks the corridor in white, door to door. The benches across from the cubicles want colour, and nobody may change on a bench.
trick: a filter and a head-on mirror go inside a cubicle, not on the way to a bench; the filtered light comes back through the door splitter onto the bench opposite, and on along the corridor to the earlier door, where it adds to that bench: red there plus green from further along makes yellow
motif: rooms (a row of three cubicles along a corridor, a bench niche opposite each)
expect: recolours>=2, reversals>=2
---
